    C: Be("In this story, what causes the opening problem at the stalls?", ["A gust scatters the price cards, hiding the costs while the fruit stays.", "The workers restore the cards, so customers cannot find the stalls.", "The fruit is sold before anyone has an order to compare.", "Gail chooses a matching card before the customer picks a basket."], "Page 4 separates the cause from the result: the gust sweeps cards from their hooks. Fruit remains, yet its cost is no longer visible. Restoring the cards comes later.")
